<sop_breakdown>

## 1. Independent Tasks/Operations in Main Procedure

Based on the SOP Main Procedure section (Section 5), the independent tasks are:

1. **KYC Verification (5.1)** - Customer identification and verification
2. **AML Sanctions Screening (5.2)** - Anti-money laundering and watchlist screening
3. **CTR Evaluation (5.3)** - Currency Transaction Report threshold evaluation
4. **Currency Validation (5.4)** - Physical cash counterfeit detection
5. **Fraud Detection Scoring (5.5)** - Real-time behavioral analytics
6. **Supervisor Approval Routing (5.6)** - Authorization limit validation
7. **Term Deposit Processing (5.7)** - CD-specific calculations
8. **Account Ledger Posting (5.8)** - Balance update and GL posting
9. **Compliance Aggregation (5.9)** - Final approval determination
10. **Receipt Generation (5.10)** - Transaction documentation
11. **Audit Trail Recording (5.11)** - Immutable record creation

## 2. External Dependencies for Each Task

**KYC Verification:**
- Third-party data aggregators for identity validation
- Customer master data repository (CIF)
- Identification document validation services

**AML Sanctions Screening:**
- OFAC SDN list database
- UN Security Council sanctions database
- Proprietary watchlists
- CRM historical transaction data

**CTR Evaluation:**
- Historical transaction database (12-month rolling window)
- FinCEN filing system interface

**Currency Validation:**
- Currency discriminator hardware
- Teller cash drawer balance system

**Fraud Detection Scoring:**
- CRM data warehouse (customer baseline profiles)
- Historical fraud incident database
- Machine learning model infrastructure

**Supervisor Approval Routing:**
- Employee authorization matrix
- Branch Manager/Regional Manager approval queues

**Term Deposit Processing:**
- Treasury rate matrix tables
- CD certificate number generation service
- Product configuration database

**Account Ledger Posting:**
- Core Banking System ledger
- General Ledger accounts
- Card production system
- Online banking provisioning system

**Compliance Aggregation:**
- All prior validation results

**Receipt Generation:**
- Thermal printer devices
- Email/SMS gateway services
- Mobile app push notification API
- CRM update interface

**Audit Trail Recording:**
- Blockchain/distributed ledger infrastructure
- Multi-tier storage systems
- Cryptographic hashing service

## 3. Edge Cases for Each Task

**KYC Verification:**
- Confidence score exactly at 85% threshold
- Multiple name variations/aliases
- Foreign identification documents
- Corporate beneficial ownership (25%+ ownership)
- Expired identification documents
- Address mismatches between systems

**AML Sanctions Screening:**
- Common names with high false positive rates
- Politically Exposed Persons (PEPs)
- Multiple fuzzy matches within edit distance
- Customer in high-risk jurisdiction
- Recent watchlist additions not yet propagated

**CTR Evaluation:**
- Deposit exactly at $10,000.00 threshold
- Multiple deposits same day totaling >$10,000
- Structured deposits ($9,800, $9,900 patterns)
- Non-cash deposits over threshold
- Multiple customers on same account

**Currency Validation:**
- Mixed genuine and counterfeit bills
- Bills marked SUSPECT vs REJECT
- Machine count mismatch with teller count
- Damaged but genuine currency
- Foreign currency mixed with USD
- Machine malfunction during counting

**Fraud Detection Scoring:**
- Score exactly at 0.30 or 0.70 thresholds
- First transaction on new account
- Geographic impossibility scenarios
- Device fingerprint mismatches
- Unusual time-of-day patterns

**Supervisor Approval Routing:**
- Teller at exact authority limit
- Multiple simultaneous approval conditions
- Supervisor unavailable/offline
- Tiered escalation to Regional Manager
- Emergency override scenarios

**Term Deposit Processing:**
- Maturity date on non-business day
- Month-end date handling (Feb 30, Apr 31, etc.)
- Rate tier boundary amounts
- Early withdrawal before minimum holding period
- Automatic renewal elections

**Account Ledger Posting:**
- Insufficient funds in funding_source_account
- Account in FROZEN or DORMANT status
- Concurrent transaction race conditions
- General ledger account mapping failures
- Card/online banking provisioning failures

**Compliance Aggregation:**
- Mixed approval/rejection states
- Override approvals without documentation
- Pending CTR filing at approval time
- Partial compliance passes

**Receipt Generation:**
- Email delivery failures
- SMS character limits exceeded
- Printer out of paper/offline
- Mobile app not installed
- Foreign language preferences

**Audit Trail Recording:**
- Storage tier migration failures
- Hash chain integrity breaks
- Retention period edge cases (leap years)
- Query performance degradation
- Legal hold conflicts with purge schedules

## 4. Key API Parameters from Dependency Graph

**KYC_Verification_API:**
- Inputs: customer_id, customer_name, customer_id_type, customer_id_number, customer_address, customer_tax_id, customer_phone, customer_email, transaction_id
- Outputs: kyc_verification_status, kyc_verification_timestamp

**AML_Sanctions_Screening_API:**
- Inputs: customer_id, customer_name, customer_address, customer_tax_id, kyc_verification_status, deposit_amount, deposit_channel, branch_code, funding_source_type, transaction_id
- Outputs: aml_screening_result, aml_risk_score, sanctions_screening_timestamp

**CTR_Evaluation_API:**
- Inputs: customer_id, deposit_amount, funding_source_type, transaction_timestamp, transaction_id, ctr_threshold_amount
- Outputs: ctr_filing_required

**Currency_Validation_API:**
- Inputs: funding_source_type, deposit_amount, cash_denomination_breakdown, cash_counter_machine_id, transaction_id
- Outputs: counterfeit_detection_result, cash_drawer_total_after_transaction

**Fraud_Detection_Scoring_API:**
- Inputs: customer_id, account_number, deposit_amount, deposit_channel, deposit_type, branch_code, transaction_timestamp, transaction_id
- Outputs: fraud_detection_score

**Supervisor_Approval_Routing_API:**
- Inputs: deposit_amount, teller_id, kyc_verification_status, aml_screening_result, aml_risk_score, fraud_detection_score, counterfeit_detection_result, ctr_filing_required, transaction_notes, transaction_id
- Outputs: supervisor_approval_required, supervisor_id, supervisor_approval_timestamp

**Term_Deposit_Processing_API:**
- Inputs: deposit_type, deposit_amount, term_length_months, transaction_timestamp, interest_rate_apy, early_withdrawal_penalty_rate, transaction_id
- Outputs: cd_certificate_number, maturity_date, calculated_interest_at_maturity

**Compliance_Aggregation_API:**
- Inputs: kyc_verification_status, aml_screening_result, aml_risk_score, counterfeit_detection_result, fraud_detection_score, supervisor_approval_required, supervisor_id, supervisor_approval_timestamp, ctr_filing_required, transaction_id
- Outputs: compliance_check_passed, transaction_approved, approval_rejection_reason

**Account_Ledger_Posting_API:**
- Inputs: account_number, deposit_amount, previous_account_balance, funding_source_type, funding_source_account, branch_code, account_type, transaction_timestamp, compliance_check_passed, transaction_approved, cd_certificate_number, transaction_id, debit_card_issued, online_banking_enabled, mobile_app_enabled, checkbook_ordered
- Outputs: new_account_balance, transaction_reference_id, account_status, processing_time_seconds, debit_card_number, final_transaction_fee

**Receipt_Generation_API:**
- Inputs: customer_name, account_number, deposit_amount, new_account_balance, transaction_reference_id, transaction_timestamp, branch_code, receipt_delivery_method, customer_email, customer_phone, cd_certificate_number, maturity_date, interest_rate_apy, calculated_interest_at_maturity, transaction_notes, transaction_approved, minimum_balance_requirement, monthly_maintenance_fee, early_withdrawal_penalty_rate, final_transaction_fee
- Outputs: receipt_number

**Audit_Trail_Recording_API:**
- Inputs: transaction_id, customer_id, account_number, transaction_timestamp, deposit_type, deposit_amount, teller_id, branch_code, kyc_verification_status, kyc_verification_timestamp, aml_screening_result, aml_risk_score, sanctions_screening_timestamp, fraud_detection_score, counterfeit_detection_result, supervisor_approval_required, supervisor_id, supervisor_approval_timestamp, compliance_check_passed, transaction_approved, approval_rejection_reason, new_account_balance, transaction_reference_id, account_status, processing_time_seconds, receipt_number, previous_account_balance, ctr_filing_required, cash_drawer_total_after_transaction
- Outputs: audit_trail_hash, audit_record_id

## 5. API Generation Approach

The API generation will follow a **sequential dependency-based approach**:

**Phase 1 - Independent Validation APIs (Parallel Execution Possible):**
- KYC_Verification_API
- CTR_Evaluation_API
- Currency_Validation_API
- Fraud_Detection_Scoring_API

**Phase 2 - Dependent Validation APIs:**
- AML_Sanctions_Screening_API (depends on KYC)

**Phase 3 - Conditional Processing APIs:**
- Term_Deposit_Processing_API (conditional on deposit_type)
- Supervisor_Approval_Routing_API (depends on Phase 1 & 2 outputs)

**Phase 4 - Aggregation and Decision APIs:**
- Compliance_Aggregation_API (depends on all validation outputs)

**Phase 5 - Transaction Execution APIs:**
- Account_Ledger_Posting_API (depends on compliance approval)

**Phase 6 - Post-Transaction APIs:**
- Receipt_Generation_API (depends on ledger posting)
- Audit_Trail_Recording_API (depends on all prior APIs)

